{# Disclosure box for pages that carry Amazon affiliate links.
   The rule is that the disclosure has to sit above the links, so this
   include is called before any product card, never after it.
   Pages can pass their own note as a named argument, for example an
   include call with note set to a sentence about how prices were
   recorded. #}
<aside class="aff-disclosure" role="note" aria-label="Affiliate disclosure">
    <p class="aff-disclosure-title">Affiliate disclosure</p>
    <p>This page contains Amazon affiliate links, marked with a sponsored tag. We earn a commission on qualifying purchases at no extra cost to you. Products were chosen first for fitting the guide, and the links follow. {{ disclosureNote or "Prices shown are reference figures recorded at publish time, not live quotes, and Amazon prices move." }}</p>
</aside>
